WEBVTT

00:00:00.408 --> 00:00:05.208
<v channel_0>Thank you for calling ACME support. This
is Sarah. How can I help you today?

00:00:05.752 --> 00:00:10.072
<v channel_1>Hi Sarah, my internet has been dropping
every evening for about a week.

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:14.744
<v channel_0>I'm sorry to hear that. Can I get the
phone number on the account?

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:20.408
<v channel_1>Sure. It's [PHONE].

00:00:21.144 --> 00:00:23.144
<v channel_0>Thanks, and the email address?

00:00:23.992 --> 00:00:28.392
<v channel_1>It's [EMAIL]

00:00:28.984 --> 00:00:33.761
<v channel_0>Perfect. I can see some line errors. I'll
schedule a technician for Thursday

00:00:33.761 --> 00:00:34.264
<v channel_0>morning.

00:00:34.776 --> 00:00:37.336
<v channel_1>That works. Thank you so much.
